The '''Colosseum''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]] where the player can fight [[Bacte]].

{{RiftGuide|Defeat Bacte|Enigma: Full Circle|Eye: Gooey|souls=1}}

== Features ==
In order to access the location, the player must have secured the {{Item|Living Timecharm}} and have a minimum of {{stat|rt|15:00}} remaining. Due to the time dilation, the player loses {{Stat|rt}} twice as slowly when in the '''Colosseum'''.

=== Bacte ===
{{Main|Bacte}}
The player can spawn [[Bacte]] in the '''Colosseum''' by hitting all the [[Globowl]]s into [[Bacte|B]], who is in the center of the Colosseum.

=== Full Circle ===
{{See also|Mole (NPC)}}
By talking to {{NPCSprite|Mole (NPC);Mole}} on one of the '''Colosseum'''<nowiki/>'s pillars, the player can start the Full Circle quest, in which they must jump on every single pillar. The next pillar they haven't yet jumped on will turn green, and once the player has jumped on all of them, [[Mole]] will grant access to the [[#Enigma Souls|Enigma Soul]] next to them. The player will receive jump boost while going full circle.

